  "description": "‘Agnes’ was a girl who saved the prince’s life by coincidence. Thanks to his kindness, she received the opportunity to serve as a chambermaid in the palace. Though initially staying with him as an old friend, An naturally fell in love with him. However, as time passed and he become emperor, she knew her unrequited love had to come to an end…\n\n“Do you like men much?”  \n“…You’re going too far.”\n\n“It’s true, is it not? Jumping from one man to another, you’re insane…”  \n“What’s wrong with me meeting with potential partners? I’m marriageable age, after all.”\n\nHearing her question, Lennox’s eyelashes trembled slightly. His claw-like hands clamped down on her, pressing her against the wall. An let out a cry and closed her eyes. But fortunately, his hand cradled the back of her head, shielding her from the wall. Trembling, she glared at him.\n\n“You clearly said you hated me.”  \n“Your Majesty.”  \n“Did you really find me that unbearable?”",
